# Stack

**RTK Query** for API calls. Components and pages never import Axios or call `fetch`.

# Layering

```
components/pages  →  RTK Query hooks  →  injectEndpoints  →  baseApi
```

| Layer | Location | Allowed |
|-------|----------|---------|
| Base API | `src/store/api/baseApi.ts` | `fetchBaseQuery`, auth header, envelope unwrap, 401 logout |
| Endpoints | `src/store/api/<domain>Api.ts` | `injectEndpoints` only |
| Session | `src/store/slices/authSlice.ts` | Persist user + token only |
| Components | `src/components/`, `src/pages/` | Generated hooks only — **no Axios, no fetch** |

```ts
// src/store/api/usersApi.ts
import { baseApi } from "@/store/api/baseApi";

export const usersApi = baseApi.injectEndpoints({
  endpoints: (builder) => ({
    getUsers: builder.query<User[], void>({
      query: () => "/users",
    }),
  }),
});

export const { useGetUsersQuery } = usersApi;
```

```tsx
// component — hooks only
const { data, isLoading, isError } = useGetUsersQuery();
```

- Endpoints → `src/utils/constants.ts` `API_PATHS`. Env → `VITE_*` only. Type all shapes; no `any`.
- Parse errors with `getApiErrorMessage` from `@/lib/api/getApiErrorMessage`.
- Persist only the login user object and auth token (`sfs-auth`).

# Loading & Empty States

| State | Use |
|-------|-----|
| Full-page loading | `LoadingScreen` |
| Button pending | `ButtonSpinner` |
| Empty / error | `EmptyState` (`variant="error"` for errors) |

Components read query state (`isLoading`, `isError`, `data`) — never manage fetch logic themselves.
